```

The main issue is that Leaflet needs to know its container size at initialization time. If the dashboard tab isn't active when the page loads, the container might have a size of 0, and the map won't render properly. The fixes above ensure the map is properly resized when the dashboard tab becomes active.

If the map still doesn't show after these changes, you might also want to check that the Leaflet CSS is loading correctly and that there are no console errors related to missing dependencies.
